Package: riverwatch
Title: RiverWatch USGS River Discharge Time-Series Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("RiverWatch", "Project", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "your-email@example.com")
Description: Reproducible analysis workflow for public USGS daily discharge
    observations, including seasonality, trend analysis, candidate change points,
    anomaly screening, and out-of-sample ARIMA forecasting.
